// What the renderer of GitHub showed for each form on which this engine and the
// renderer of Bun differ.
//
// tests/link-renderer.test.ts holds the engine against the renderer of Bun on forms it
// generates. On a few hundred of them the two differ, each time by one of four habits
// of that renderer which the test names. Each of those forms was put to the Markdown
// API of GitHub on 2026-10-08, in the mode a pull request description is rendered in,
// and the letters it showed are kept here. The engine agreed with GitHub on every one.
//
// A form may hold half a surrogate pair, which cannot be sent to anything as UTF-8.
// Such a form was sent with U+FFFD in place of each half, which is what the renderer
// of Bun makes of one as well. It is kept here as the test generates it.
//
// Every character outside plain ASCII is written as its escape, so that this file
// holds none.
// No test asks the API again: the answers were asked once and kept, as the answers of
// the CommonMark reference are kept in reference-blocks.ts.
//
// Each entry is the document, and then every letter GitHub showed for it, in order,
// with nothing between. An image counts as its alternative text.

